    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<h1 align=\"center\">Tacit</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Learns what you leave unsaid in your prompts — and tells the agent for you.</b><br>\nA plugin for <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@deepseek-ai/dsh\">DeepSeek Harness</a>.</p>"
