      "section": "Help shape Tacit",
      "text": "PRs are welcome — the fork → branch → PR walkthrough is in\n[CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/hackernotfound/dsh-tacit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).\nNo API key is needed to run the tests."
    },
